# Character System

Two character tracks. **Do not mix.** Wallpaper is a third path (`wallpaper` skill): lock the person as a cutout, reconstruct a simplified background, place them with `scripts/make_wallpaper.py compose`, then fuse and adapt to iPhone / iPad / Desktop. A lock-screen product shot of an existing still is a fourth path (`wallpaper-demo`): photoreal iPhone, screen shows the still, brand text only if the user supplied it. Neither path uses the couple style gate or the Tagame anime pipeline.

## Track A — Teo / Kai (photoreal)

- **Teo** — 受, default LEFT, `characters/teo/`
- **Kai** — 攻, default RIGHT, `characters/kai/`

## Track B — Tagame (Japanese anime)

- **Tagame** — 办公室肌肉上司, solo, `characters/Tagame/`
- Skill: `tagame-anime`（台词多样，先选项再视频词）+ `douyin-caption`（抖音 / 猛男日语教学）
- Style: high-quality Japanese anime / digital illustration by default. **CuteGuysArt** only when the user names that style (`.cursor/skills/cuteguysart/SKILL.md`)
- Never photoreal, never Teo/Kai, never `gemini-video` photoreal paste

## Hard rules (Teo/Kai)

1. Character Bible controls face, body, hair, glasses, personality look
2. Scene reference controls composition, pose, environment, lighting only — **match exposure**; do not brighten (over-bright = AI look)
3. NEVER swap Teo and Kai positions or identities
4. NEVER describe identities of people in scene reference photos
5. Use Cursor `GenerateImage` with scene + character reference paths
6. Default output: 3:4 vertical for 小红书
7. **TWO-TURN PROTOCOL:** Turn 1 = analyze + post numbered style options + STOP. Turn 2 = generate after user replies. See `AGENTS.md` and `style-gate.mdc`.
8. **POSE SERIES:** Existing approved still + 系列/换姿态 → `pose-series` skill. Lock identity + outfit + environment; only pose changes. Turn 1 = numbered pose options + STOP.
9. **TEXT SCENE:** Words only, no photo → `text-scene` skill. Fill a complete scene from bibles, post the card, wait; then one image.
10. **GEMINI VIDEO:** Approved still + 图生视频/10秒视频 → `gemini-video` skill. Write a copy-paste Gemini prompt; Japanese kana dialogue. Do **not** call GenerateImage.
11. **XHS CAPTION:** After pose-series (or 文案/标题/标签) → `xiaohongshu-caption`. Names **Teo**（受）/ **Kai**（攻）. Do **not** call GenerateImage.
12. **COVER COLLAGE:** 2+ stills + 拼接/封面图/九宫格 → `cover-collage`. Turn 1 = 3 schemes + copy + STOP. Turn 2 = Pillow `make_cover.py`, one 1080×1440 PNG. **Never** GenerateImage.

## Hard rules (Tagame)

1. Bible + `characters/Tagame/references/face_01.jpeg` lock face, beard, hair, extreme muscle
2. **Anime lock** on every still and every i2v prompt. Default is Japanese anime. **CuteGuysArt** only when the user names that style; keep the same face, beard, hair, and clothes-on rule
3. No user still: generate one anime still from `characters/Tagame/references/face_01.jpeg`, scene inferred from the dialogue (or office default). Do not wait for a scene photo. Then **read still first** → **5 diverse dialogue options, wait** → 10s video prompt. If the user already pasted Japanese or English lines: skip options; split long copy into independent 10s clips (next clip = last frame of previous). Do not default every video to invite → heat → possession
4. Direct address to the viewer (`おまえ` / 你). First spoken line at 2.0s
5. Clothes stay on (suit / wet shirt / undone buttons). No Teo/Kai pipeline skills
6. **DOUYIN CAPTION:** After the video prompt (or 抖音文案/标题/标签) → `douyin-caption`. Account **猛男日语教学**. Do **not** call GenerateImage.

## User triggers

When user uploads a photo and asks 壁纸 / wallpaper / /wallpaper / iPhone壁纸 / iPad壁纸 / 桌面壁纸 → **`wallpaper`**. Do not post clothing options. Do not wait. Not for @Tagame.

When user points at an existing still and asks 壁纸演示图 / 锁屏展示 / 锁屏效果图 / 手机锁屏壁纸展示 → **`wallpaper-demo`**. Generate one iPhone lock-screen product shot. Do not wait. Do **not** write `汉克壁纸` or `MR.HUNK WALLPAPER` unless the user supplied them.

When user uploads scene + @Teo/@Kai/@virtual-couple → **Turn 1: post options and wait**. Do NOT generate until user confirms choices.

When user points at `outputs/approved/` (or similar) and asks for 系列/换姿态 → **pose-series Turn 1**. Do NOT generate until user picks poses.

When user describes a scene in text with no photo → **text-scene Turn 1**. Do NOT generate until they confirm the filled card.

When user points at an approved **Teo/Kai** still and asks 图生视频 / Gemini视频 / 10秒视频 → **gemini-video**. Write a copy-paste prompt. Do NOT call GenerateImage. If the still is Tagame / anime → **tagame-anime C1** (dialogue options first) unless they already pasted Japanese/English lines (then C2 / C2-S).

When pose-series finishes, or user asks 文案 / 标题 / 标签 / 小红书发布 → **xiaohongshu-caption**. Copy-paste title + body + tags. Names in copy: Teo / Kai. Do NOT call GenerateImage.

When user has series stills and asks 拼接 / 封面图 / 九宫格 / 拼图 / 首页封面 → **cover-collage Turn 1**. Post 3 schemes + copy and wait. Do NOT run `make_cover.py` or GenerateImage until they pick a scheme.

When user @Tagame / `characters/Tagame` / `docs/anime.md` → **tagame-anime**. If they have **no still** and already pasted lines (or said 生成/出图): GenerateImage from Tagame face ref, scene matching the lines — do not wait for a scene card. If they pasted Japanese/English lines: skip the 5 options, write 10s i2v (split long copy into independent clips). Otherwise read the still, post 5 diverse dialogue options and wait. Only STOP on a scene card when they @Tagame with no lines and no generate request.

When Tagame video lines are locked, or user asks 抖音文案 / 抖音标题 / 抖音标签 / 猛男日语教学 → **douyin-caption**. Copy-paste title + teaching body + tags. Do NOT call GenerateImage.
